<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>nōma — Smart serviced stays | nōma Stays</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="tokens.css" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="site.css" />
<style>
  .seg { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: var(--line); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-md); overflow: hidden; }
  .seg .item { background: var(--surface-card); padding: 28px 26px; }
  .seg .item .i { color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .seg .item .i [data-lucide] { width: 26px; height: 26px; stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .seg .item h3 { font-size: var(--text-md); margin: 0 0 7px; }
  .seg .item p { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0; line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); }
  @media (max-width: 980px) { .seg { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
</style>
</head>
<body data-page="noma" class="brand-noma">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero page-hero" style="min-height:480px">
    <div class="hero-photo">
      <img src="assets/photo-arabella-room.jpg" alt="" />
      <img src="assets/photo-balcony.jpg" alt="" />
    </div>
    <div class="hero-veil noma-grain" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(35,40,55,.40), rgba(20,28,45,.86))"></div>
    <div class="wrap" style="width:100%">
      <span class="eyebrow">The nōma brand · serviced buildings of 25+ rooms</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-wide)">nōma</h1>
      <p class="lede">In Arabic, <em>noma</em> means sleep. Smart serviced apartments where the comfort of home meets the wonder of travel — everything you need, nothing you don't.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE MODEL -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap two-col">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow muted">The model</span>
        <h2 class="title-lg" style="margin:14px 0 18px">Smart stays, honest prices.</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:16px">nōma operates whole buildings of 25+ rooms as serviced apartments — spacious studios and one-bedrooms with kitchenettes, quality essentials done perfectly, and none of the inflated extras that inflate the bill.</p>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:16px">No breakfast buffet you didn't ask for. No gym you won't use. Instead: a real kitchen, real living space, real housekeeping, real security — at a price that makes staying weeks as sensible as staying nights.</p>
        <p class="lede serif" style="font-style:italic">Affordable. Spacious. Comfortable. Great locations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="prop-cta" style="position:static">
        <span class="eyebrow">nōma at a glance</span>
        <div>2 buildings · 72 rooms</div>
        <div>From <b><span data-egp="2400"></span></b> / night</div>
        <div class="note">Studios &amp; one-bedrooms · long-stay friendly · on every OTA, cheapest here</div>
        <a class="btn btn-accent" href="book.html?property=arabella">Check availability</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHO IT'S FOR -->
  <section class="section tight" style="border-top:1px solid var(--line)">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Made for the way you travel</span>
      </div>
      <div class="seg">
        <div class="item"><div class="i"><i data-lucide="briefcase"></i></div><h3>Business travellers</h3><p>Workspace, fast Wi-Fi, weekly rates and locations near Cairo's business districts.</p></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="i"><i data-lucide="globe"></i></div><h3>Tourists &amp; explorers</h3><p>Gulf and international travellers doing Cairo properly — pyramids, GEM and beyond.</p></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="i"><i data-lucide="stethoscope"></i></div><h3>Medical stays</h3><p>10 days to 2 weeks of recovery-friendly comfort, near Cairo's hospitals.</p></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="i"><i data-lucide="home"></i></div><h3>Long stays &amp; locals</h3><p>Students, relocations, families between homes — monthly rates that make sense.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICES -->
  <section class="section" id="services">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head row">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">nōma services</span>
          <h2 class="title-lg" style="margin-top:14px">Included as standard</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:38ch">Every nōma building is run by our own on-ground team — not a call centre, not a lockbox.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc">
        <div class="item"><div class="i"><i data-lucide="sparkles"></i></div><h3>Housekeeping</h3><p>Professional cleaning by our trained in-house team — daily service available.</p></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="i"><i data-lucide="shield-check"></i></div><h3>24/7 security</h3><p>Round-the-clock personnel and controlled building access.</p></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="i"><i data-lucide="bell-ring"></i></div><h3>Front desk &amp; support</h3><p>On-site property team plus a direct guest line on WhatsApp.</p></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="i"><i data-lucide="wrench"></i></div><h3>Maintenance on call</h3><p>Something not working? Fixed fast — usually same day.</p></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="i"><i data-lucide="bed-double"></i></div><h3>Hotel-quality linen</h3><p>Fresh linen and towels, professionally laundered, changed on schedule.</p></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="i"><i data-lucide="chef-hat"></i></div><h3>Equipped kitchenettes</h3><p>Cook, store, live — every unit comes ready for real life.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="note" style="margin:18px 0 0">On request: airport transfers · laundry · concierge &amp; experiences · late check-out · long-stay packages. Final add-on menu confirmed per property.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ARABELLA -->
  <section class="section prop-sec" id="arabella">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">New Cairo · opening June 2026</span>
          <h2 class="title-xl" style="margin-top:12px">nōma Arabella</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-accent" href="book.html?property=arabella">Check availability</a>
      </div>
      <div class="prop-gallery">
        <div class="g lead"><img src="assets/photo-arabella-room.jpg" alt="A nōma serviced apartment interior in New Cairo" /><span class="chip noma chip-tl">Flagship</span><span class="cap">Studio interior</span></div>
        <div class="g"><img src="assets/photo-balcony.jpg" alt="Balcony of a nōma apartment" /><span class="cap">Balcony &amp; light</span></div>
        <div class="g"><img src="assets/photo-arabella-social.jpg" alt="New Cairo neighbourhood life" /><span class="cap">The neighbourhood</span></div>
        <div class="g"><img src="assets/photo-woman-reading.jpg" alt="A guest reading at a nōma apartment" /><span class="cap">Made for long stays</span></div>
        <div class="g"><img src="assets/photo-statue.jpg" alt="Cairo landmarks minutes away" /><span class="cap">Minutes from the city</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="note" style="margin:8px 0 0">Interiors and styling shown reflect the nōma standard; final property photography of Arabella added at opening.</p>
      <div class="prop-facts" style="margin-top:22px">
        <div class="f"><div class="l">Status</div><div class="v">Opening June 2026</div></div>
        <div class="f"><div class="l">Rooms</div><div class="v">40 — studios &amp; 1BR</div></div>
        <div class="f"><div class="l">Room types</div><div class="v">6 layouts</div></div>
        <div class="f"><div class="l">Location</div><div class="v">Arabella, New Cairo</div></div>
        <div class="f"><div class="l">From</div><div class="v"><span data-egp="2400"></span> / night</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="two-col">
        <div>
          <p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:16px">Our flagship. Forty fully refurbished studios and one-bedrooms with kitchenettes and real living space — backed by housekeeping, security and an on-site team, around the clock. Minutes from New Cairo's business districts, universities and malls, and a direct drive from the airport.</p>
          <p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:26px">Whether you're here for three nights or three months, Arabella is a base, not just a bed.</p>
          <ul class="amen">
            <li>Kitchenette with essentials</li>
            <li>Quality linen &amp; towels</li>
            <li>High-speed Wi-Fi</li>
            <li>Air conditioning &amp; smart TV</li>
            <li>Workspace &amp; living area</li>
            <li>Weekly housekeeping (daily available)</li>
            <li>24/7 security &amp; controlled access</li>
            <li>Front desk &amp; luggage storage</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="prop-cta">
          <span class="eyebrow">Book your stay</span>
          <div class="price"><span data-egp="2400"></span> <small>– <span data-egp="5300"></span> / night</small></div>
          <p class="note">Indicative range by unit type and season. Final rates at checkout via Cloudbeds — payable in EGP or USD.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-accent" href="book.html?property=arabella">Check availability</a>
          <p class="note">Long stay (28+ nights)? Ask about monthly rates — hello@nomastays.com</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ROOM TYPES -->
      <div class="sec-head" style="margin-top:40px">
        <span class="eyebrow">Room types · Arabella</span>
        <h3 class="title-lg" style="margin-top:10px">Six ways to stay</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="roomtypes">
        <div class="rt">
          <div class="rt-top"><h4>Studio</h4><span class="rt-from">from<b><span data-egp="2400"></span></b></span></div>
          <span class="rt-spec">~28–32 m² · sleeps 2</span>
          <p>Open-plan living with a full kitchenette, comfortable double and a dedicated workspace.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rt">
          <div class="rt-top"><h4>Studio with Balcony</h4><span class="rt-from">from<b><span data-egp="2700"></span></b></span></div>
          <span class="rt-spec">~30–34 m² · sleeps 2</span>
          <p>The studio layout with a private balcony — morning coffee or evening air, your way.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rt">
          <div class="rt-top"><h4>Deluxe Studio</h4><span class="rt-from">from<b><span data-egp="3100"></span></b></span></div>
          <span class="rt-spec">~34–38 m² · sleeps 2</span>
          <p>A larger studio with an upgraded finish, a seating nook and premium bedding.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rt">
          <div class="rt-top"><h4>One-Bedroom</h4><span class="rt-from">from<b><span data-egp="3800"></span></b></span></div>
          <span class="rt-spec">~45–52 m² · sleeps 2–3</span>
          <p>A separate bedroom plus a full living room — a proper home for longer stays.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rt">
          <div class="rt-top"><h4>One-Bedroom with Balcony</h4><span class="rt-from">from<b><span data-egp="4300"></span></b></span></div>
          <span class="rt-spec">~48–55 m² · sleeps 2–3</span>
          <p>One-bedroom comfort with a private balcony and the best light in the building.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rt">
          <div class="rt-top"><h4>Deluxe One-Bedroom</h4><span class="rt-from">from<b><span data-egp="4800"></span></b></span></div>
          <span class="rt-spec">~55–60 m² · sleeps 2–3</span>
          <p>Our most spacious layout: generous living, a premium finish and the full nōma standard.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="note" style="margin:14px 0 0">Sizes and from-rates are indicative and vary by floor and season; final layout and price confirmed at checkout.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DISTRICT 9 -->
  <section class="section prop-sec" id="district9">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Sheikh Zayed · opening Q1 2027</span>
          <h2 class="title-xl" style="margin-top:12px">nōma District 9</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="book.html?property=district9">Join the waitlist</a>
      </div>
      <div class="prop-photo"><img src="assets/photo-palms.jpg" alt="" />
        <span class="chip noma chip-tl">Under construction</span><span class="cap">Renderings coming soon</span></div>
      <div class="prop-facts">
        <div class="f"><div class="l">Status</div><div class="v">Opening Q1 2027</div></div>
        <div class="f"><div class="l">Rooms</div><div class="v">32 — studios &amp; 1BR</div></div>
        <div class="f"><div class="l">Room types</div><div class="v">6 layouts</div></div>
        <div class="f"><div class="l">Location</div><div class="v">District 9, Sheikh Zayed</div></div>
        <div class="f"><div class="l">From</div><div class="v"><span data-egp="2400"></span> / night</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="two-col">
        <div>
          <p class="lede" style="margin-bottom:16px">The nōma standard moves west. Thirty-two serviced apartments six minutes from Arkan Plaza, within easy reach of West Cairo's business hubs, schools and landmarks — the full formula: kitchenettes, housekeeping, 24/7 security, long-stay friendly.</p>
          <p class="lede">Currently under construction and on track for Q1 2027.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="prop-cta">
          <span class="eyebrow">Opening Q1 2027</span>
          <div class="price"><span data-egp="2400"></span> <small>– <span data-egp="5300"></span> / night</small></div>
          <p class="note">Indicative range; opening rates announced closer to launch.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-accent" href="book.html?property=district9">Join the waitlist</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#arabella">Staying sooner? See Arabella</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ROOM TYPES -->
      <div class="sec-head" style="margin-top:40px">
        <span class="eyebrow">Room types · District 9</span>
        <h3 class="title-lg" style="margin-top:10px">The same six layouts, moving west</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="roomtypes">
        <div class="rt"><div class="rt-top"><h4>Studio</h4><span class="rt-spec">~28–32 m²</span></div><p>Open-plan living with a full kitchenette and a dedicated workspace.</p></div>
        <div class="rt"><div class="rt-top"><h4>Studio with Balcony</h4><span class="rt-spec">~30–34 m²</span></div><p>The studio layout with a private balcony.</p></div>
        <div class="rt"><div class="rt-top"><h4>Deluxe Studio</h4><span class="rt-spec">~34–38 m²</span></div><p>A larger studio with an upgraded finish and seating nook.</p></div>
        <div class="rt"><div class="rt-top"><h4>One-Bedroom</h4><span class="rt-spec">~45–52 m²</span></div><p>A separate bedroom plus a full living room for longer stays.</p></div>
        <div class="rt"><div class="rt-top"><h4>One-Bedroom with Balcony</h4><span class="rt-spec">~48–55 m²</span></div><p>One-bedroom comfort with a private balcony.</p></div>
        <div class="rt"><div class="rt-top"><h4>Deluxe One-Bedroom</h4><span class="rt-spec">~55–60 m²</span></div><p>The most spacious layout — the full nōma standard.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="note" style="margin:14px 0 0">Planned layouts for District 9; sizes indicative and opening rates announced closer to launch.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GROWTH BAND -->
  <section class="band noma-grain" style="padding:clamp(56px,7vw,90px) 0">
    <div class="wrap" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow on-dark">Growing fast</span>
        <p class="band-quote" style="margin-top:16px">150 rooms by the end of 2027.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost on-dark" href="partner.html">Own a building? Let's talk <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@0.460.0/dist/umd/lucide.min.js"></script>
  <script src="chrome.js"></script>
</body>
